WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.838 --> 00:00:17.621
Benjamin gulped.

2
00:00:17.622 --> 00:00:21.465
Peter dropped a few candies.

3
00:00:21.466 --> 00:00:24.624
"You lost your boot?" he said.

4
00:00:24.625 --> 00:00:29.531
"Yes!" the mouse cried.

5
00:00:29.532 --> 00:00:33.351
"What will I do?"

6
00:00:33.352 --> 00:00:34.987
Peter thought fast.

7
00:00:34.988 --> 00:00:41.427
"We'll look for your house."

8
00:00:41.428 --> 00:00:45.795
The bunnies hopped back to the shop.

9
00:00:45.796 --> 00:00:49.190
"We need the boot," Benjamin said.

10
00:00:49.191 --> 00:00:51.559
The shopkeeper shook his head.

11
00:00:51.560 --> 00:00:53.770
"Sorry," he said.

12
00:00:53.771 --> 00:00:56.545
"Mrs. Tiggywinkle just bought it."

13
00:00:56.546 --> 00:00:59.635
"Oh no," Peter said.

14
00:00:59.636 --> 00:01:06.114
"We must find Mrs. Tiggywinkle," Benjamin said.

15
00:01:06.115 --> 00:01:09.810
The bunnies hopped fast to Mrs. Tiggywinkle's house.

16
00:01:09.811 --> 00:01:12.951
Candies fell out of their pockets.

17
00:01:12.952 --> 00:01:16.941
But they did not see them.

18
00:01:16.942 --> 00:01:26.298
The bunnies knocked on Mrs. Tiggywinkle's door.

19
00:01:26.299 --> 00:01:29.414
"Do you have the boot?" Peter asked.

20
00:01:29.415 --> 00:01:32.752
Mrs. Tiggywinkle sighed.

21
00:01:32.753 --> 00:01:35.344
"I painted a pretty picture on it.

22
00:01:35.345 --> 00:01:38.334
I wanted to use it for dirty socks.

23
00:01:38.335 --> 00:01:42.639
But it was too heavy."

24
00:01:42.640 --> 00:01:46.422
Peter grinned. "Can we have it?"

25
00:01:46.423 --> 00:01:49.663
"No," Mrs. Tiggywinkle said.

26
00:01:49.664 --> 00:01:52.264
She held up an old hat.

27
00:01:52.265 --> 00:01:54.599
"Jemima gave me this hat.

28
00:01:54.600 --> 00:02:01.078
I gave her the boot."
